WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,430 --> 00:00:01,330
Rest

2
00:00:02,510 --> 00:00:03,470
Want to go for a walk

3
00:00:03,470 --> 00:00:05,030
Slightly lost freedom

4
00:00:06,100 --> 00:00:07,100
Everything around me belongs to me

5
00:00:07,540 --> 00:00:12,680
We've been driving all day and let's lie down for a while.

6
00:00:18,100 --> 00:00:19,180
Do you have any intuition?

7
00:00:19,420 --> 00:00:23,020
It’s strange whether this lake is dangerous or not

8
00:00:23,420 --> 00:00:24,980
I think it's quite safe

9
00:00:25,420 --> 00:00:26,340
The lake is not deep

10
00:00:26,340 --> 00:00:29,340
You can't support big monsters, right? Taihu Lake isn't very deep either.

11
00:00:33,140 --> 00:00:34,380
Take a look around with a drone

12
00:00:34,780 --> 00:00:37,620
At night, I can see it clearly in Rechengxiang. I want to see it.

13
00:00:43,020 --> 00:00:46,060
If you all come to Feifei tonight and practice more, everyone will be fine.
